{"ID":"20240513083134-qill4n2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083134-qill4n2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083134-qill4n2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513155517-d7qucf3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513155517-d7qucf3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513155517-d7qucf3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:745,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:745\u0026#125;","title":"198","type":"doc","updated":"20240515122159"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513155517-d7qucf3","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 971px;","id":"20240513155517-d7qucf3","updated":"20240515122159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：04/30/2008 (以往皆傳真看病)"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"165 C, T"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"69     中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"04/30/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"攝護腺癌, 大腿內側(肝經)如有物欲下之感("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"內有陰實但尚未完全堵住, 小腸火有時可下行有時不可, 故有此感"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") PSA高於16("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"正常為四"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")(病人未開過刀)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 足溫不冰"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 重聽(腎開竅於耳)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 右手皮膚乾燥 (小腸火不下行, 因內有陰實, 又反逆至心, 致胸腔過熱則熱傳手足, 津液因此蒸化, 故右手皮乾.)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 睡眠好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 大便每日行, 有時三至四次."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 手足不麻"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 胸口不痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 口渴不重(熱反逆)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、 睡時不覺身冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、 頻尿, 夜間三,四次.小便淡白.有時可見血絲(因食鈣片導致結石),小便不痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃濕"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 裡熱重 (此熱反逆) 陰實"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"關元 中極 水道 三陰交 陰陵泉 太衝"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此處不用地機, 因病人雙腳無水腫現象."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連二錢 黃芩三錢 黃柏三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 三黃瀉心湯(病人苔黃濕, 脈洪大. 此方可以降熱)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烏藥五錢 細辛二錢 滑石六錢 豬苓三錢 茯苓五錢 澤瀉五錢 瓦楞子五錢 牡蠣五錢 麥冬五錢 西洋蔘三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 (上二味針對大腿內側\u003c肝經\u003e如有物欲下之感) "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拾付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮成三碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"攝護腺與膀胱內之尿液, 依賴小腸之火蒸化, 常人不會累積多餘水分.足溫便因小腸之溫可正常循環至腳. 但若內有陰實, 又不完全結實, 造成部分堵道. 則此熱時可下時不可下, 故病人覺得有物欲下. 病人右手皮膚乾燥(見問診), 便因肺之津液被蒸化. 治則為補肺津(因肺津滋潤皮膚). 治心使心火下移小腸. 然後攻堅."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"療程中須多走路"}]}]}]}]}